        "content": "## MedFlow — 30min Reminder\n\n30-minute reminder template.\n\n**Webhook path:** `medflow/reminder-30min`\n**MedFlow env (outbound from MedFlow):** `N8N_WEBHOOK_REMINDER_30M`\n**Callback:** `POST /api/webhooks/reminders`\n\nFinal pre-visit reminder tier.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "804ef00d-3119-43d1-acb7-f583dc9138fa",
